nterpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-satisfaction-—-满足关系-$\\models$\">df-satisfaction — 满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(S=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}[S]\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"76bbac386a4be5a3\" href=\"?note=76bbac386a4be5a3\" title=\"29-df-term-interpretation\">29-df-term-interpretation</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|\">\\(a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:D\\to|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(\\alpha:D\\to|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\varphi)\\subseteq D\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\varphi)\\subseteq D\\)</span>；局部赋值的记法仅在此条件下使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> 为互异变量元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{|\\bar x|}\">\\(\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{|\\bar x|}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(1)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(t_1\\doteq t_2)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow t_1^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta]=t_2^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(1)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(t_1\\doteq t_2)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow t_1^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta]=t_2^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(2)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models R_i(t_1,\\ldots,t_{a_i})[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow (t_1^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_{a_i}^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta])\\in R_i^{\\mathfrak{A}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(2)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models R_i(t_1,\\ldots,t_{a_i})[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow (t_1^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_{a_i}^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta])\\in R_i^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(3)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\neg\\psi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak{A}\\not\\models\\psi[\\beta]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(3)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\neg\\psi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak{A}\\not\\models\\psi[\\beta]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(4)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\psi\\land\\chi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\psi[\\beta]\\land\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\chi[\\beta])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(4)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\psi\\land\\chi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\psi[\\beta]\\land\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\chi[\\beta])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(5)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\psi\\lor\\chi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\psi[\\beta]\\lor\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\chi[\\beta])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(5)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\psi\\lor\\chi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\psi[\\beta]\\lor\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\chi[\\beta])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(6)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\psi\\to\\chi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak{A}\\not\\models\\psi[\\beta]\\lor\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\chi[\\beta])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(6)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\psi\\to\\chi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak{A}\\not\\models\\psi[\\beta]\\lor\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\chi[\\beta])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(7)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\chi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\bigl((\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\chi[\\beta])\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(7)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\chi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\bigl((\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\chi[\\beta])\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(8)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\forall x\\,\\psi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\psi[\\beta[a/x]])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(8)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\forall x\\,\\psi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\psi[\\beta[a/x]])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(9)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\exists x\\,\\psi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\psi[\\beta[a/x]])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(9)\\;\\mathfrak{A}\\models(\\exists x\\,\\psi)[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\psi[\\beta[a/x]])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\top[\\beta],\\qquad\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\bot[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\top[\\beta],\\qquad\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\bot[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\alpha]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\alpha)\\;\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\gamma],\\qquad D\\neq\\mathrm{Var}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\alpha]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\alpha)\\;\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\gamma],\\qquad D\\neq\\mathrm{Var}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\\bigl(\\gamma(\\bar x)=\\bar a\\to\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\gamma]\\bigr),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\\bigl(\\gamma(\\bar x)=\\bar a\\to\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\gamma]\\bigr),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上述有限公式树递归适用于任意非空结构，不要求论域有限；这为原书 Theorems 1.34–1.35 的有限及无限模型解释补齐接口。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi[\\beta]\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi[\\beta]\\)</span> : 结构<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span>在赋值<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>下满足公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-satisfaction-—-满足关系-$\\models$","text":"df-satisfaction — 满足关系 $\\models$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"76bbac386a4be5a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-term-i